        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86567, Clear Crystal Providence Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Providence Crystal Cabinet Knob is available in two sizes with stem colors ranging from the very modern to the traditional. Each of the Clear Crystal Providence Cabinet Knobs comes packaged with the mounting hardware. This transitional cabinet knob is ideal for new installs and kitchen remodels. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Providence Cabinet Drawer Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Crystal with Brass Stem</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86567-specifciation.gif?v=1704354685\" width=\"551\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86567 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86567:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86568:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
